woven of flame that will keep you warm even in the coldest weather.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-24T17:31:17-08:00","id":1021752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1021350-hedgespun-items-rework-2e?p=1021713#post1021713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A classic item I hope to still fall under the hedge spun rules is a scarf woven of flame that will keep you warm even in the coldest weather.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have a look at the Epic Item level stuff! Contracts could absolutely allow for that at ST discretion!<br /> <br /> Though now that it's a decent hour I'm wondering...<br /> What if I bought cloak of the bears massive form for an item...<br /> I need to rework how I do contracts in relation to hedgespun items, but the general gist is there so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">I'm a nascent AI, just call me Blue.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000ff\">I use blue writing because it's my name....</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-los